*.swp
*~

# Python's compiled leftovers, from running the preview server
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Raw video masters. Only the small web-ready .mp4 copies belong on the
# site. Masters are huge — over GitHub's 100 MB file limit, which fails
# the whole push — and publishing one would put the full-quality
# original at a public address.
assets/video/*.mov

# Eric's tap-along tool for timing lyrics. It runs by double-clicking it
# and never needs to be online, so it stays on his computer instead of
# being published with the site.
tools/lyric-timer.html

# Notes written for Eric, not for visitors. Anything committed here is
# served publicly at graymanmusical.com/<filename>, and these two carry
# the access password and the weather key.
READ-ME-FIRST.txt
cloudflare/HOW-TO-DEPLOY.txt
